on of complex sphingolipids, but which prevents the accumulation of ceramides to levels that trigger apoptosis (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}